   "path": "sections.limits.1.zh",
   "before": "吴起在楚的改革与身死，原文叙述简略：能确认的是明法审令、裁去不急之官、废公族疏远者，以及南平百越、北并陈蔡、却三晋、西伐秦这些记述，此外的细节本文不再补写。上文与下文中标注为作者推断、作者提出的替代选择，均属解释与反事实，用于讨论，不构成史实。",
   "after": "吴起在楚的改革与身死，原文叙述简略：能确认的是明法审令、裁去不急之官、废公族疏远者，以及南平百越、北并陈蔡、却三晋、西伐秦这些记述；还有悼王死后宗室大臣作乱攻打吴起，吴起伏在王尸上，射刺他的人也射中了王尸，事后因此被灭宗的有七十余家。此外的细节本文不再补写。上文与下文中标注为作者推断、作者提出的替代选择，均属解释与反事实，用于讨论，不构成史实。",
   "issues": [
    "F3"
   ]
  },
  {
   "path": "sections.limits.1.en",
   "before": "The account of Wu Qi's reforms in Chu and of his death is brief. What can be confirmed is the clarifying of laws and the careful framing of orders, the cutting of unneeded offices, the removal of distant members of the royal clan, and the campaigns — south against the Hundred Yue, north absorbing Chen and Cai, repelling the Three Jin, west against Qin. Beyond these the article adds nothing. Wherever the text above or below marks a view as an authorial inference or an author's alternative, it is interpretation and counterfactual, offered for discussion, not history.",
   "after": "The account of Wu Qi's reforms in Chu and of his death is brief. What can be confirmed is the clarifying of laws and the careful framing of orders, the cutting of unneeded offices, the removal of distant members of the royal clan, and the campaigns — south against the Hundred Yue, north absorbing Chen and Cai, repelling the Three Jin, west against Qin. Also on record: after King Dao died, men of the royal house and the great ministers rose and attacked Wu Qi; he lay over the king's body; those shooting at him struck the royal corpse as well; and afterward more than seventy clans were destroyed for it. Beyond these the article adds nothing. Wherever the text above or below marks a view as an authorial inference or an author's alternative, it is interpretation and counterfactual, offered for discussion, not history.",
   "issues": [
    "F3"
   ]
  },
  {
