  {
   "path": "sections.analysis.0.en",
   "before": "Step back and look at the design. It trades an unanswerable question — does he mean to stay? — for a visible act: does he accept the marriage? The servant's reading of Wu Qi is on the record — in translation, that he was a man of integrity and restraint who cherished his good name. That is the history's description of him, not a sketch invented here. One explanation for the scheme's success: Wu Qi, seeing the princess treat the chancellor so cheaply, declined the match. Agreeing to a marriage while the household he was visiting was being humiliated would not fit the name-cherishing character the servant attributed to him. He acted just as the servant had predicted, and stepped into a frame drawn around that reading of his character.",
   "after": "Step back and look at the design. It trades an unanswerable question — does he mean to stay? — for a visible act: does he accept the marriage? The servant's reading of Wu Qi is on the record — in translation, that he was a man of integrity and restraint who cherished his good name. That is the history's description of him, not a sketch invented here. One explanation for the scheme's success: Wu Qi, seeing the princess treat the chancellor so cheaply, declined the match. Agreeing to a marriage while the household he was visiting was being humiliated would not fit the name-cherishing character the servant attributed to him. He acted just as the servant had predicted, and stepped into a frame drawn around that reading of his character. (The author's interpretation.)",
   "issues": [
    "V1-V1"
   ]
  }
